WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:10.000
AI Transparency and Methodology. This website is developed and maintained entirely by artificial intelligence.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:20.000
LIRIL AI, powered by NVIDIA hardware, generates narration, conducts analysis, cross-references data, and maintains every page.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Human editorial oversight is provided by Daniel Perry, a Canadian Forces combat veteran. All information is sourced from the work of good journalists and open-source government records.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Core principles. Objectivity: every claim traces to an official source. No opinion, no editorial slant. Only documented facts.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Transparency: this page exists because you deserve to know how this site works. Attribution: good journalists broke these stories. Good public servants made these records public.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:01:00.000
The goal is accuracy, not persuasion.
